    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wash cars,  and grow your own Car Wash company in this relaxing simulator game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wash, foam and relax. Feel the satisfying experience.  </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> START WASHING!  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy and intuitive mechanics </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Jump to the action straight away-\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111030/extras/1b83a6eaab479326bdc4fce7ee7c2bd1.poster.avif?t=1753281653\" width=618 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111030/extras/1b83a6eaab479326bdc4fce7ee7c2bd1.webm?t=1753281653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111030/extras/1b83a6eaab479326bdc4fce7ee7c2bd1.mp4?t=1753281653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect cards and welcome new customers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From small sedans to large SUVs and even trucks, wash a wide range of cars and earn money for each one you clean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111030/extras/7b07979a39442c79d2b27498514c235b.poster.avif?t=1753281653\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111030/extras/7b07979a39442c79d2b27498514c235b.webm?t=1753281653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"ht